<title>CHINA: Tian Teck Land year net rises 17.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Tian Teck Land year net rises 17.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   26.0   vs 22.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    6.2    vs 5.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    122.33 vs 104.37</p>
<p>    Turnover		     628.80 vs 577.58</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tian Teck Land Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 5-12</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 30</p>
<p>NOTE - Tian Teck Land is an investment holding company with hotel and property rental and sales interests.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nine H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.8 cents) vs eight cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
